# ---- Planning / internal docs (always local, never committed) ----
# This repo is public. Roadmaps, PRDs, research notes, and AI-agent planning
# scratch space stay on your own machine so each contributor's in-flight plans
# don't collide or leak into shared history. Keep working code and setup docs
# in the tracked tree; put planning artifacts in one of these conventional
# spots and git will never see them.
.planning/
docs/prd/
docs/plans/
*.local.md

# Local Claude Code session settings
.claude/

# Playwright MCP browser-testing artifacts (screenshots/console logs)
.playwright-mcp/
